  "historyNote": "#5718, eff 1-1-94; ss by #6086, eff 1-1-96; ss by #6629, eff 1-1-98; ss by #8119, eff 1-1-05; ss by #9249, eff 1-1-09, EXPIRED: 1-1-17 New. #12510, eff 4-6-18",
